@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Test data and storage isolation
rectangle "Selected candidate test environment" {
 component "Synthetic owner, non-owner and visitor" as Users
 database "Dedicated automated test database" as DB
 folder "Controlled temporary Git fixtures" as Git
 artifact "Disposable tokens, refs and commits" as Fixtures
}
rectangle "Unrelated data: outside test mutation scope" {
 database "Development and production databases" as RealDB
 folder "Source checkout and unrelated repositories" as RealGit
}
Users --> DB : test identities and sessions
Fixtures --> DB : test metadata
Fixtures --> Git : disposable content and refs
note bottom of RealDB : Confirm effective database before destructive tests
note bottom of RealGit : Containment probes must not mutate unrelated paths
note bottom of Fixtures : Never commit or expose token secrets; clean up owned fixtures
@enduml
